---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import WhatsAppCTA from '../../../components/conversion/WhatsAppCTA.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="County Budget Audit · Precinct 4"
  description="Lupe Negrete's commitment to audit Maverick County public funds: strict oversight, transparency, and eliminating wasteful government spending."
  lang="en"
  pageType="WebPage"
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Issues', href: '/en/issues/' }, { name: 'Auditing the budget', href: '/en/issues/audit/' }]}
>
  <section class="bg-navy-950 text-white py-14 md:py-20 border-b-4 border-slate-700">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-4">
      <a href="/en/issues/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 hover:text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
        ← Back to all issues
      </a>
      <div class="inline-block bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-amber-400 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest px-3 py-1 rounded-full">
        Key Issue · Fiscal Accountability
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black font-heading text-white leading-tight">
        Safeguarding Every Taxpayer Dollar
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-lg">
        Independent audits, ending wasteful court expenditures, and total fiscal accountability for Maverick County.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <article class="py-16 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-12">
    
    <!-- AI-optimized summary answer -->
    <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border-l-8 border-slate-800 border-y border-r border-slate-200 shadow-md space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy-950">
        How will Lupe Negrete ensure transparency in Maverick County finances?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base text-slate-800 leading-relaxed font-medium">
        Lupe Negrete will push for an exhaustive external audit of all Maverick County Commissioners Court accounts and public contracts, making line-item spending publicly accessible online and cutting wasteful overhead to direct funds into paving, lighting, and colonia services.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- The Local Problem -->
    <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-800 text-base leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-navy-950">Lack of Accountability and Unchecked Overhead</h2>
      <p>
        County funds belong to the working taxpayers of Maverick County. For years, the commissioners court has approved budgets where it is difficult for everyday residents to see where their tax dollars actually go.
      </p>
      <p>
        While officials claim lack of funds for basic road paving in Precinct 4, administrative waste continues. We need an independent commissioner with the courage to inspect every invoice without political entanglements.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Candidate Photo at Courthouse -->
    <div class="rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-200">
      <img
        src="/images/candidate-courthouse.png"
        alt="Lupe Negrete in front of Maverick County Courthouse"
        class="w-full h-auto object-cover"
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <div class="bg-slate-50 p-4 text-xs text-slate-600 border-t border-slate-200 text-center">
        Lupe Negrete at the County Courthouse: a steadfast commitment to fiscal oversight and integrity.
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Commitments -->
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-navy-950">Pillars of Fiscal Integrity</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4">
        
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex items-start gap-4">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-100 text-slate-900 font-black flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">1</span>
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-navy-950 text-base">Independent Audits of Public Works Contracts</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Verifying cost efficiency and execution timelines for all current and future county infrastructure projects.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex items-start gap-4">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-100 text-slate-900 font-black flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">2</span>
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-navy-950 text-base">Public Open-Budget Online Portal</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Giving every resident direct online access to inspect county expenditures and vendor contracts in real time.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex items-start gap-4">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-100 text-slate-900 font-black flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">3</span>
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-navy-950 text-base">Eliminating Wasteful Spending</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Cutting travel allowances, unnecessary administrative purchases, and inflated consultant fees.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Contextual WhatsApp Action -->
    <div class="bg-navy-900 text-white p-8 rounded-3xl text-center space-y-6 shadow-xl">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-black font-heading text-white">
        Want to know more about our fiscal plan?
      </h3>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm max-w-lg mx-auto">
        Message us on WhatsApp to share your concerns or feedback regarding Maverick County public funds.
      </p>
      <div>
        <WhatsAppCTA
          source="auditoria"
          lang="en"
          label="Inquire about the audit on WhatsApp"
          variant="primary"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Navigation -->
    <div class="pt-8 border-t border-slate-300 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-bold">
      <a href="/en/issues/lighting/" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-navy-900">
        ← Previous: Street Lighting & Safety
      </a>
      <a href="/en/issues/paving/" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-navy-900">
        View Road Paving proposal →
      </a>
    </div>

  </article>
</BaseLayout>
